<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Addressing Pitfalls in the Evaluation 
<br class="ltx_break">of Uncertainty Estimation Methods 
<br class="ltx_break">for Natural Language Generation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
